@startuml
title Attendance Management System - Architecture
left to right direction

actor User

package "Interface" {
  [CLI / Scripts] as CLI
  [(Optional) Web UI] as WebUI
}

package "Application" {
  [Importer] as Importer
  [Attendance Service] as AttendanceSvc
  [Student Service] as StudentSvc
}

package "Persistence" {
  database "SQLite DB\n(attendance.db)" as DB
}

User --> CLI : runs commands
User --> WebUI : optional
CLI --> Importer : reads CSV
Importer --> StudentSvc : create/update students
CLI --> AttendanceSvc : mark attendance
AttendanceSvc --> DB : write attendance records
StudentSvc --> DB : read/write students

note right of DB
Schema (example):
 - students(id, name, ...)
 - attendance(id, student_id, date, marked_at)
end note

@enduml
